### Trajectory Description
The variable $x_1$ exhibits a periodic, oscillatory behavior over the 10-second 
interval:

1.  **Initial Phase (0s to ~1.5s):** The trajectory starts at $x_1 \approx 18$ 
at $t=0$. It increases steadily, reaching its first local maximum of 
approximately 29 at $t \approx 1.5$s.
