  - $b$ (stiffness/gain on $x_1$): $-0.53157$                                   
  - $c$ (constant offset): $0.89496$                                            
                                                                                
**Transition Logic (Guards):**                                                  
- **Guard 1 (Switch to Mode 2):** $x_1 \ge 25.05$                               
- **Guard 2 (Switch to Mode 1):** $x_1 < 25.05$                                 
                                                                                
